        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>手玉に取る</choice_text>
          <commentary>手玉に取る이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>手を染める</choice_text>
          <commentary>手を染める는 '손을 대다, 착수하다'이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>手を打つ</choice_text>
          <commentary>手を打つ는 '대책을 세우다'이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>手も足も出ない</choice_text>
          <commentary>手も足も出ない는 '속수무책이다'이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
